    <!-- Track: budget-honest status (budget-ux). "Filtering on" is only honest while short video
         is actually gated: the sleep window is active, or the daily budget is spent. While budget
         remains nothing is filtered, so the hub pill says it is paused and how much time is left.
         The service-off copy must never reuse the word "paused" — that word now means "budget left". -->
